  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water. Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over a high heat until tender, 12 minutes.\n• Drain and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b349e02ccb8b03ddc0f5a4-ac3f9884.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop capsicum. Drain sweetcorn.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based mince, soffritto mix and capsicum, breaking up with a spoon, until browned, 4-5 minutes. Add corn, stirring, until heated through, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b349e02ccb8b03ddc0f5a4-8b5c2fe2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium, add Mexican fiesta spice blend and tomato paste and cook, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water and butter and cook until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat and stir in baby spinach leaves, until wilted, 1 minute. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b349e02ccb8b03ddc0f5a4-d0866d75.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rapid rice and Mexican plant-based mince between bowls. Dollop over light sour cream and tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b349e02ccb8b03ddc0f5a4-4e5b650e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
